{{~##
   One page per abstract type: the members every variant carries, then each variant with the
   members it declares of its own.

   Two sections rather than one, because they answer different questions. The common members
   are what any consumer may read without asking which variant it has; the variants are what it
   has to ask about. Flattened into one table the distinction is gone, and that distinction is
   the whole of what the declaration says. spec/types/polymorphism.md sections 5.1 and 7.1.

   **And the relationship is drawn, not merely implied by order.** The two used to be an `h2`
   and a run of `h3`s, which at 41 variants is a wall of headings of one weight with nothing
   saying what hangs off what. The common members are a panel; the variants are cards on a rail
   that runs down from it, each joined to the rail by a stub. A type with more than a handful
   also gets its names as one row of chips, because a page nobody can see the whole of is a
   page nobody navigates.

   The discriminator is not a member and is not listed. What a cell holds is a variant name and
   what the file carries is that variant's number, which is the badge beside each variant's
   name below - section 5.1.1 says why the number is fixed rather than positional.
##~}}
{{~ include 'html-head.sbn' ~}}
<p class="lead" id="struct_{{ name }}"><svg class="i"><use href="#i-struct"></use></svg>{{ name }} &middot; 변종 {{ variants | array.size }}개 &middot; 공통 멤버 {{ base_members | array.size }}개</p>
{{~ if comment != '' ~}}
<p class="comment">{{ comment }}</p>
{{~ end ~}}
{{~ if used_by | array.size > 0 ~}}
<p class="hint">이 타입으로 선언된 그룹:
{{~ for item in used_by ~}}
<a href="{{ item.href }}">{{ item.name }}</a>{{ if !for.last }}, {{ end }}
{{~ end ~}}
</p>
{{~ else ~}}
<p class="hint">이 타입으로 선언된 그룹이 없습니다.</p>
{{~ end ~}}

{{~## Past a handful the list of names is the thing a reader wants first. ##~}}
{{~ if variants | array.size > 6 ~}}
<div class="chips">
{{~ for variant in variants ~}}
<a href="#variant_{{ name }}.{{ variant.name }}">{{ variant.name }}</a>
{{~ end ~}}
</div>
{{~ end ~}}

<div class="base">
<h2>공통 멤버 <span class="count">{{ base_members | array.size }}</span></h2>
{{~ if base_members | array.size == 0 ~}}
<p class="none">모든 변종이 가지는 멤버가 없습니다. 변종마다의 멤버만으로 이루어진 타입입니다.</p>
{{~ else ~}}
<p class="hint">아래 변종 {{ variants | array.size }}개가 모두 가집니다. 그래서 옵셔널이 아닌 컬럼입니다.</p>
<div class="scroll">
<table>
<thead>
<tr class="names"><th>이름</th><th>타입</th><th>설명</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{{~ for member in base_members ~}}
<tr><td>{{ member.name }}</td><td>{{ member.type_cell }}</td><td>{{ member.comment }}</td></tr>
{{~ end ~}}
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
{{~ end ~}}
</div>

{{~ if variants | array.size == 0 ~}}
<p class="none">선언된 변종이 없습니다.</p>
{{~ else ~}}
<div class="variants">
{{~ for variant in variants ~}}
<div class="variant" id="variant_{{ name }}.{{ variant.name }}">
<h3><svg class="i"><use href="#i-struct"></use></svg>{{ variant.name }}<span class="tag" title="파일이 싣는 번호">@{{ variant.discriminator }}</span>{{ if variant.members | array.size > 0 }}<span class="tag">멤버 {{ variant.members | array.size }}개</span>{{ end }}</h3>
{{~ if variant.comment != '' ~}}
<p class="comment">{{ variant.comment }}</p>
{{~ end ~}}
{{~ if variant.members | array.size == 0 ~}}
<p class="none">이 변종이 따로 선언하는 멤버가 없습니다.{{ if base_members | array.size > 0 }} 공통 멤버만 가집니다.{{ end }}</p>
{{~ else ~}}
<div class="scroll">
<table>
<thead>
<tr class="names"><th>이름</th><th>타입</th><th title="같은 멤버를 선언하는 다른 변종">공유</th><th>설명</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{{~ for member in variant.members ~}}
<tr><td>{{ member.name }}</td><td>{{ member.type_cell }}</td><td>{{ if member.shared != '' }}<span class="hint">{{ member.shared }}</span>{{ end }}</td><td>{{ member.comment }}</td></tr>
{{~ end ~}}
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
{{~ end ~}}
</div>
{{~ end ~}}
</div>
{{~ end ~}}
{{ include 'html-foot.sbn' }}
